# Perf-audit artifacts (~74 MB at the repo root). These are gitignored, but a CLI
# deploy reads .vercelignore instead of .gitignore, so they need listing here too
# or every `vercel deploy` uploads them.
lighthouse-report*
lh-*.json
*.report.html
*.report.json
test-results
scratch
# Secrets must never ride along in a CLI deploy. Production env comes from the
# Vercel dashboard; an uploaded .env is retrievable through the deployment files
# API and silently overrides the dashboard at build time. Keep the example.
# BEFORE THE NEXT DEPLOY: confirm every var in lib/env-guard.ts's FATAL list is
# set in the Vercel project settings, or the build fails closed (which is the
# intended safe behaviour — see AUDIT-REPORT.md "Secrets & deploy").
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Dead legacy static bundle (~unused, excluded from tsconfig/eslint) — uploaded
# on every deploy otherwise and carries ~60 unsanitised innerHTML sinks.
legacy-static
